            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "keylime"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My mom gave me a copy of the Make-Ahead Cookie Mix clipped from a magazine many years ago. It came with TEN variations. The Butterball Recipe did not call for brown sugar- perhaps this is why yours spread out and were soft and messy."
          },
          {
