            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melissa Conger"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It flattens into a standard cookie as it cooks and is nutty, chewy, and has a caramel/toffee flavor. It's ok, but not the \"buttery cookie\" you would expect, as described.",
